Shared Resource Scenario
------------------------

	2 process p1 and p2 want to access the same shared data.

	To avoid data corruption, a lock variable r1 is used.

		- p1, p2 -> Processes 
		- data -> Shared resource 
		- r1 -> Lock variable 
		
			r1 = 0 -> Resource is free
			r1 = 1 -> Resource is busy / locked

	
Diagram (Conceptual)
--------------------

	+-----------+        +------+
	|  P1       | -----> | data |
	+-----------+        +------+
	       |
 	       r1
	       |
	+-----------+        +------+
	|  P2       | -----> | data |
	+-----------+        +------+


	Working critical section 

		1. Process p1 checks r1 
	
			if r1 == 0, resource is free 
		
		2. p1 enters critical section

			sets r1 = 1 (lock accquired)
			write data into shared 
			
		3. while p1 is inside critical section 
	
			r1 == 1
			process p2 checks r1
			since r1 == 1, p2 waits 

		4. p1 finishes its work 
	
			sets r1 = 0 (lock released)

		5. p2 now enters critical section 

			sets r1 = 1
			writes data 
			after completion, sets r1 = 0

















		
















